# Excludes files from the Cloudflare Workers static-assets upload
# (wrangler.jsonc -> assets.directory "."). Wrangler serves this repo's
# files directly with no build step, so everything NOT listed here is
# public on the live site — dist/*.min.js and the rest of the app is
# meant to be public, these are not.
#
# Added after a deploy started failing with "Asset too large": .git's own
# pack file crossed Cloudflare's 25 MiB per-asset limit as the repo grew,
# which blocks every future deploy (not just the one that first hit it)
# until .git is excluded here. node_modules/.wrangler/.github/.claude were
# never meant to be public either — same fix, while this file is being
# added anyway.
.git/
node_modules/
.wrangler/
.github/
.claude/
